#subtitle: Improving Presidential Relation.

= Presidential Relation

Our relationship with with Piłsudski has been mixed after he left the party. although the Presidency had been weaken by the constitution, it is still ideal to have the President to our side if we wish to lead the Sejm.


- @meeting
- @no
- @easy_discard

@meeting
title: Arrange a meeting with the President.
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; president_relation += 8; president_confidence += 6 if pps_in_government

The meeting was well recieved, we were able to build a relationship with the President.

